{"baseRefName":"main","baseRefOid":"4661a24b599d75503a997f3ce122f3ad2da77048","body":"This M1 milestone PR composes typed scope reads and the run-job surface lease owner with configured acquisition, renewal, release and ownership-loss handling. Native criterion reads preserve current membership, required fields and canonical identity. Typed session permissions/tools now reach both SDK adapters; HTTP inputs become domain commands before queueing, and interrupted gate reads restore their observation window.\n\nHistorical head `873855e` has a tree identical to the independently reviewed policy and cancellation candidate. Source extraction maps 56 files and 286 hunks, with 134 exact donor AST claims independently checked. Root policy controls passed 468 tests, and cancellation controls passed 122 tests; the policy predecessor's full gate passed 3,666 tests with 16 skips. [Independent evidence and limits](https://linear.app/duckburg/issue/KOD-73#comment-c4d8b688-49ff-4e96-a58b-6c8261efc4ca).\n\nCurrent head `241e85c` adds the independently reviewed pretty-logging extraction and synchronized dispatch-timeout oracle. Fresh integrated113 tests passed56.37s, covering actual logging/MCP reopen and before/during-dispatch cancellation. [Current full CI](https://github.com/YalDan/kodezart/actions/runs/34719625215/job/103622955364) is running. The prior873 full gate passed3,676 tests with16 skips; its local counterexamples are retained and corrected here. Logging preserves the original5s reopen checks in real JSON/pretty configuration and avoids live traceback-local traversal. The dispatch oracle preserves its original10ms cancellation budget and mark/call assertions after explicit entry synchronization. [Logging review](https://linear.app/duckburg/issue/KOD-61#comment-5416fa1c-667c-4d60-a2f1-fbcd4699249a) · [Oracle review](https://linear.app/duckburg/issue/KOD-73#comment-c5a621dc-6f83-4183-a5e0-bad39eccab28).\n\nPartial extraction based on main `4661a24`, 150 changed files. Complete M1 acceptance, remaining configuration/consumer migration and seven-milestone recomposition remain pending. No live backend fencing or adapter acceptance is claimed. Historical drafts remain preserved.\n\n[Full-progress transfer manifest](https://linear.app/duckburg/initiative/kodezart-v03-loop-orchestration-scopes-as-input-the-tracker-as-live-97c2509ef1b8#comment-3ae7f771-d30e-43fc-8357-b2892b666abc) · [Resume checkpoint](https://app.notion.com/p/3d4f89e34d1081018a12c8991e5e9ae3)\n","comments":[],"files":[{"path":".env.example","additions":9,"deletions":8,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"README.md","additions":3,"deletions":3,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"docs/architecture.md","additions":39,"deletions":2,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"docs/configuration.md","additions":28,"deletions":12,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"docs/cutover_mapping.md","additions":8,"deletions":0,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"docs/migration-v0.1-to-v0.2.md","additions":17,"deletions":17,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"docs/operation.example.toml","additions":16,"deletions":0,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"pyproject.toml","additions":1,"deletions":0,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"src/kodezart/adapters/_agents_mapping.py","additions":24,"deletions":0,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"src/kodezart/adapters/_permission_modes.py","additions":13,"deletions":14,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"src/kodezart/adapters/agent_content_scanner.py","additions":2,"deletions":2,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"src/kodezart/adapters/asyncio_job_queue.py","additions":4,"deletions":9,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"src/kodezart/adapters/claude_agent_executor.py","additions":12,"deletions":6,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"src/kodezart/adapters/claude_client_executor.py","additions":12,"deletions":6,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"src/kodezart/adapters/git_change_persister.py","additions":3,"deletions":3,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"src/kodezart/adapters/linear_markers.py